            "target_entity_instance": "Ghana",
            "target_entity_type": "Country",
            "paragraph": "Specifically, while Abbam et al (2018) found no significant Tmin trends for the region as a whole, our study identified significant increasing trends at the Wa and Bole stations, located in this region [Upper West Region].",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
