            "target_entity_instance": "Ghana",
            "target_entity_type": "Country",
            "paragraph": "While Abbam et al (2018) reported non-significant Tmin trends in the Upper East Region, which is consistent with the findings for Navrongo in our study, some nuanced differences emerged regarding the Upper West Region.",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "Tamale",
            "source_entity_type": "City",
            "relation": "IN_COUNTRY",
            "target_entity_instance": "Ghana",
            "target_entity_type": "Country",
            "paragraph": "These observations are in close agreement with Iddrisu et al (2025), who identified variable monthly trends, especially for Tmax, in the Tamale Metropolis. Minor differences in the significance of specific monthly trends, such as those observed for March and June in Tamale, may arise from the fact that Iddrisu et al (2025) used an average of five stations, whereas our study focused on individual station dynamics.",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
